    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rtuk](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rtuk) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 140.692 depth occurred on Dec 10 2025 18km S of Piedecuesta. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 6.8277 longitude -73.0581. It impacted 831835 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
